{"id":"00003","root":"uni00003_1","name":{"ja":"クラクル","en":"Crackle"},"title":null,"displayName":{"ja":"クラクル","en":"Crackle"},"element":"Superhuman","rarity":6,"rarityLabel":"LR","roles":[],"traits":[],"release":"2018-09-25","limited":false,"characterId":3,"profile":{"ja":"いつの間にかヨミハラの一角に住み着いていた猫の獣人。奔放だが、素直な性格で、どこの組織にも属してはいないが、高い戦闘能力ゆえに周囲の者達から一目置かれている。対魔忍や米連に属する人間と戦ったことがあるが、戦いを遊びと考える性質の為に、敵と言うよりも遊び相手感覚でいる。外見こそ人間に近いもののその本質は猫に近く、フラフラと自身のテリトリーを回って食料を得ている。飢えた場合は盗みを働いたり、他の生き物を狩ったりすることを厭わない。だが、逆に食料を与える者にはすぐ懐く為に、近隣に住む者にはマスコットの様に可愛がられている。基本食べることと遊ぶこと、寝ることしか考えていない。食材そのものも調理された料理も好き嫌いせずに食べるが、猫舌なので熱い物は苦手である。","en":"She is a cat-folk who somehow took up residence in a corner of Yomihara. Free-spirited yet honest, she belongs to no organization, but her high combat ability earns her the respect of those around her. She has fought Taimanin and members of the US forces, but treats battle as a game, viewing opponents more as playmates than enemies. Though her appearance is close to human, her essence is feline; she roams her territory aimlessly, hunting for food. When starving, she does not hesitate to steal or hunt other creatures, yet she quickly becomes attached to anyone who feeds her, and the locals adore her like a mascot. Her thoughts revolve around eating, playing, and sleeping. She eats both raw ingredients and cooked dishes without preference, but her cat tongue makes hot food uncomfortable."},"illustrator":"のぶしと","voiceActor":"藤井ねここ","forms":[{"id":"uni00003_1","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","levelMax":80,"stats":{"hp":[1230,2460],"sp":[150,150],"atk":[163,327],"def":[130,262],"spd":[78,78],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":36,"skills":["1","12"]},{"id":"uni00003_2","rarity":5,"rarityLabel":"UR","levelMax":90,"stats":{"hp":[1860,3722],"sp":[250,250],"atk":[251,504],"def":[205,409],"spd":[78,78],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":36,"skills":["1","12","13"]},{"id":"uni00003_3","rarity":6,"rarityLabel":"LR","levelMax":100,"stats":{"hp":[2490,4984],"sp":[300,300],"atk":[339,678],"def":[240,